cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use this app, please cite the work it implements (preferred-citation), this release, and Pennsieve (RRID:SCR_021677); the other works it builds on are listed under references.
type: software
title: Spatial Transcriptomics QC
abstract: Quality control and normalization of spatial transcriptomics samples (Visium spots, Visium HD
  bins, Xenium / MERSCOPE / CosMx cells). Removes outlier observations with adaptive MAD thresholds or
  fixed cutoffs, keeps the raw counts, log-normalizes, selects highly variable genes and computes a PCA,
  with per-sample tables and figures.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/st-qc
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- spatial-transcriptomics
- transcriptomics
- genomics
- single-cell
- visium
- xenium
- merscope
- cosmx
- quality-control
- normalization
